# Internal documentation — docs/ contents stay private by default.
#
# Published set = the three key guides (architecture / installation / usage)
# plus the reference material that was already public before the reorg.
# Anything NOT listed here stays local-only (client briefings, OKF design notes,
# slide decks, carrier_studio assets). Add a line when a new doc should ship.
#
# NOTE: a file cannot be re-included while its parent directory is excluded, so
# docs/reference/ and docs/reference/plans/ are un-ignored before their files.
docs/*
!docs/.gitkeep

# ── docs tree (published) ──
